petstore-ee7-uml
================

This repository is an adaptation of "agoncal-application-petstore-ee7" by
Antonio Goncalves (https://github.com/agoncal/agoncal-application-petstore-ee7),
licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).

Baseline
    The application source is unchanged from upstream commit 725839c
    ("Bump Primefaces Themes", 2025-01-23), tagged here as upstream-725839c.
    All 105 upstream commits are preserved with their original authorship.

Changes made in this repository
    - docs/ added: UML 2.5.1 model (PlantUML), architecture views and ADRs
      (arc42, C4), interface design and wireframes, REST API review and
      proposed OpenAPI 3.1 contract, test strategy and test case catalogue.
    - LICENSE and NOTICE files added (the upstream repository states its
      licence only in README.md).
    Later changes are recorded in the git history of this repository.

Licence of the adaptations
    The adaptations are licensed under the same licence, CC BY-SA 3.0,
    as required by section 4(b) of that licence.

Third-party names and tools
